{"abstract":"Hvad indeholder jordmoderprofessionen - omsorg, håndværk eller akademiske kompetencer? Vi beskriver opbygningen af uddannelsen og forholdet mellem teori og praksis samt spændingsforholdet melem en mesterlærepraksis og akademisk videnskabelig tilgang.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Lindahl, Linda Dahl Skjoldborg","Møller, Bodil Kirstine","Funge, Julia Kadin"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-390289"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Jordemoder","Uddannelse professioner og erhverv","jordemoderprofession"],"level":"pop","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"jordemoderuddannelsen mellem mesterlære og akademisering","src":["kp"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-390289","ids":["kp-a0b0f4fc-cc7a-40a6-a19d-2efd4097776e"],"keyword":["Uddannelse, professioner og erhverv","jordemoder","jordemoderprofession"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-892A87BC8878E165B0A94025D44D1A6C"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for sundhedsuddannelser - Dekan, Jordemoderuddannelsen"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Linda Dahl Skjoldborg","key":"lindahlpau","last":"Lindahl","locid":"df46a751-23fa-447c-b9af-0c8b18f057e5","name":"Lindahl, Linda Dahl Skjoldborg","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bodil Kirstine","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"c43ebc43-917c-4b24-bbb7-fda81112e9fd","name":"Møller, Bodil Kirstine","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Julia Kadin","key":"fungepau","last":"Funge","locid":"380324bb-a1f0-4d8c-a4bb-faf4d2136e84","name":"Funge, Julia Kadin","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Katja","key":"schrøderpedh","last":"Schrøder","name":"Schrøder, Katja","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Anna-Maja Rosbjerg","key":"vilhelmsenpedh","last":"Vilhelmsen","name":"Vilhelmsen, Anna-Maja Rosbjerg","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Marie Louise Mastrup","key":"knudsenpedh","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Marie Louise Mastrup","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788750057802"],"pages":"87-97","place":"København","publisher":"Akademisk Forlag","status":"p","title":"Jordemoder, profession, identitet og fortællinger"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kp-a0b0f4fc-cc7a-40a6-a19d-2efd4097776e"],"src":["KP University College Copenhagen"],"title":"Jordemoderuddannelsen mellem mesterlære og akademisering","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-390289","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Community-acquired Staphylococcus aureus bacteremia (SAB) was associated with twice the odds for infective endocarditis (IE), as compared with healthcare-associated SAB. We identified no significant difference in short-term mortality between community-acquired and healthcare-associated S aureus IE. Background Staphylococcus aureus bacteremia (SAB) can be community-acquired or healthcare-associated, and prior small studies have suggested that this mode of acquisition impacts the subsequent prevalence of infective endocarditis (IE) and patient outcomes. Methods First-time SAB was identified from 2010 to 2018 using Danish nationwide registries and categorized into community-acquired (no healthcare contact within 30 days) or healthcare-associated (SAB >48 hours of hospital admission, hospitalization within 30 days, or outpatient hemodialysis). Prevalence of IE (defined from hospital codes) was compared between groups using multivariable adjusted logistic regression analysis. One-year mortality of S aureus IE (SAIE) was compared between groups using multivariable adjusted Cox proportional hazard analysis. Results We identified 5549 patients with community-acquired SAB and 7491 with healthcare-associated SAB. The prevalence of IE was 12.1% for community-acquired and 6.6% for healthcare-associated SAB. Community-acquired SAB was associated with a higher odds of IE as compared with healthcare-associated SAB (odds ratio, 2.12 [95% confidence interval {CI}, 1.86-2.41]). No difference in mortality was observed with 0-40 days of follow-up for community-acquired SAIE as compared with healthcare-associated SAIE (HR, 1.07 [95% CI, .83-1.37]), while with 41-365 days of follow-up, community-acquired SAIE was associated with a lower mortality (HR, 0.71 [95% CI, .53-.95]). Conclusions Community-acquired SAB was associated with twice the odds for IE, as compared with healthcare-associated SAB. We identified no significant difference in short-term mortality between community-acquired and healthcare-associated SAIE. Beyond 40 days of survival, community-acquired SAIE was associated with a lower mortality.","author_count":24,"contributors":["Østergaard, Lauge","Voldstedlund, Marianne","Bruun, Niels Eske","Bundgaard, Henning","Iversen, Kasper","Køber, Nana","Dahl, Anders","Chamat-Hedemand, Sandra","Petersen, Jeppe Kofoed","Jensen, Andreas Dalsgaard","Christensen, Jens Jørgen","Rosenvinge, Flemming Schønning","Jarløv, Jens Otto","Moser, Claus","Andersen, Christian Østergaard","Coia, John","Marmolin, Ea Sofie","Søgaard, Kirstine K.","Lemming, Lars","Køber, Lars","Fosbøl, Emil Loldrup"],"cuid":["S04-098.06-665857"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"corresponding_author":["Østergaard, Lauge"],"keyword":["Community acquired","Echocardiography","Endocarditis","Infective endocarditis","Patient registry","Risk Factors","SYSTEM","Staphylococcus aureus bacteremia","TOOL","healthcare associated"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Regionshospital Nord"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"prevalence and mortality of infective endocarditis in community acquired and healthcare associated i staphylococcus aureus i bacteremia a danish nationwide registry based cohort study","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/ofid/ofac647","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S04-098.06-665857