-85074931508"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-ac817f26-3501-4d80-8a4e-5ddf512b7443","sdu-53ad6e6f-8f49-45ea-ad60-8e8029384c08"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Early follow-up after open heart valve surgery reduces healthcare costs : A propensity matched study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.86-045257","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Data describe supplementary tables and figures related to the research article; Effect of early, individualised and intensified follow-up after open heart valve surgery on unplanned cardiac hospital readmissions and all-cause mortality [1]. Data on patients undergoing open heart valve surgery were presented in 308 patients in a prospective cohort and compared with 980 patients in a historical cohort. Included figures show inclusion and exclusion of patients (flowchart)and the specific elements of the intervention. Tables show causes of readmission and sensitivity analyses of differences among patients in the prospective intervention group compared with patients in the historical control group. Further results, interpretation and discussion of the included data can be found in the main research paper.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Borregaard, Britt","Dahl, Jordi Sanchez","Riber, Lars Peter Schødt","Ekholm, Ola","Sibilitz, Kirstine Lærum","Weiss, Marc","Sørensen, Jan","Berg, Selina Kikkenborg","Møller, Jacob Eifer"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-044506"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Borregaard, Britt"],"country":["Ireland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Royal College of Surgeons in Ireland"],"keyword":["Heart valve surgery","Heart valves","Propensity matched","Readmission"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"data on an intervention to reduce readmissions after open heart valve surgery","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dib.2019.103926","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The authors would like to acknowledge the patients for participating. Furthermore, the following grant supporters should be acknowledged for their financial support; Helsefonden , The Odense University Hospital PhD foundation, Ove William Buhl Olesen and Edith Buhl Olesen Foundation , and Kurt Bønnelycke and Grethe Bønnelycke Foundation funded this research. The funders had no role in the design and conduct of the study; collection, management, analysis, and interpretation of the data; or in the preparation, review, and approval of the manuscript."],"id":"S02-100.00-044506","identifier":[{"id":"85064312431","type":"scopus"},{"id":"31193065","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC6515132","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-9479ee35-209f-41dd-a78f-1deff509c008","sdu-71cded66-2552-4f21-b65c-86a591f1814b"],"keyword":["Heart valve surgery","Heart valves","Propensity matched","Readmission"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-576A766DB281FD8C25DF6794A3378723"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/230150340/1_s2.0_S235234091930277X_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dib.2019.103926","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/150135605/Data_on_an_intervention_to_reduce_readmissions_after_open_heart_valve_surgery.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of H